  "operative_text": "Section 1 (C.R.S. 18-4-203(2)(c)): THE OBJECTIVE OF THE BURGLARY IS THE THEFT OF ONE OR MORE FIREARMS OR AMMUNITION.\nSection 2 (C.R.S. 18-1.3-401(1)(a)(III)(F)): ON AND AFTER THE EFFECTIVE DATE OF THIS SUBSECTION (1)(a)(III)(F), IF A PERSON IS CONVICTED OF SECOND DEGREE BURGLARY AS DESCRIBED IN SECTION 18-4-203 (2)(c), IN ADDITION TO ANY OTHER SENTENCE, THE COURT MAY REQUIRE THE PERSON TO PAY A FINE OF AT LEAST FIVE THOUSAND DOLLARS BUT NOT EXCEEDING SEVEN HUNDRED FIFTY THOUSAND DOLLARS."
}